# EventType: 1110043101
# Descriptor: [B0 -> Xsd [ -> K_S0 [ -> pi+ pi-] eta [ -> pi+ pi- pi0 [ -> gamma gamma] ] ] gamma]cc
# NickName: Bd_Xsdgamma_KS0eta_pi+pi-pi+pi-pi0
# Documentation: photon polarization with TDCPV analysis, eta -> pi+ pi- pi0
# Tested: No
# Physics WG: TDCPV
# Responsible: Rishabh Mehta
# Email: rishabh.mehta@tifr.res.in
# Cuts: None
# Date: 20261016
#

Alias MyK_S0 K_S0

Alias Myeta eta

Alias Mypi0 pi0

Alias MyXsd Xsd
Alias Myanti_Xsd anti-Xsd
ChargeConj MyXsd Myanti_Xsd

Alias MyB0 B0
Alias Myanti-B0 anti-B0
ChargeConj MyB0 Myanti-B0

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.000    MyB0 Myanti-B0 B0  anti-B0  VSS_BMIX dm;
Enddecay

Decay MyB0
1.000    MyXsd  gamma  BTOXSGAMMA 2;
Enddecay
CDecay Myanti-B0

Decay MyXsd
1.00    Myeta MyK_S0  VSS;
Enddecay
CDecay Myanti_Xsd

Decay MyK_S0
1.000    pi- pi+ PHSP;
Enddecay

Decay Myeta
1.000 pi- pi+ Mypi0 ETA_FULLDALITZ -1.128 0.153 0.0 0.085 0.0 0.173;
Enddecay

Decay Mypi0
1.000 gamma gamma PHSP;
Enddecay

End
